@startuml
title Mobile push client — register + deliver + deep-link (happy path)

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica

actor Partner
participant "Mobile app\n(frontend-flutter)" as App
participant "Firebase\n(Auth + FCM)" as FB
participant "Backend API\n(Go, api.ledgerspear.com)" as API
participant "NotificationService\n+ sync" as Svc

== Registration (after sign-in) ==
Partner -> App : sign in
App -> FB : FirebaseAuth sign-in
App -> App : request notification permission
App -> FB : getToken() (FCM)
FB --> App : fcmToken
App -> API : POST /api/v1/devices\n{device_token, platform}
API -> Svc : RegisterDevice(userID, token, platform)
Svc --> API : ok (upsert)
API --> App : 200

== Token refresh ==
FB -> App : onTokenRefresh(newToken)
App -> API : POST /api/v1/devices {newToken, platform}

== Delivery + deep-link ==
Svc -> Svc : risk-state change (sync)
Svc -> FB : SendPush(token, title, body,\n data{type, app_id, subscription_id})
FB -> App : push (foreground/background/tap)
Partner -> App : taps notification
App -> App : go_router.go(route from data payload)
note right of App : missing/invalid data -> Dashboard fallback

== Logout ==
Partner -> App : sign out
App -> API : DELETE device (unregister) then FirebaseAuth.signOut
@enduml
